13pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">◀ 아&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 래 ▶</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;1. 신청 기간&nbsp; : 2009. 11. 17(화) ～ 11. 19(목)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;2. 신청 장소&nbsp; : 복수전공 및 부전공 해당 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">“종합학사행정실”</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-INDENT: -177.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 177.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">복수전공포기(변경)자</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> : 신청원을 작성하여 소속 학부장을 경유</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">(날인)&nbsp;&nbsp; 한 후 복수전공(변경) 학부장에게 제출</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-INDENT: -178.1pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 178.1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나.</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 1pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 5.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">부전공포기자 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">: 신청원을 작성하여 소속 학부장을 경</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">유(날인)&nbsp;&nbsp; 한 후 부전공 학부장에게 제출</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-INDENT: -178.1pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 178.1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">3. 제출 서류 : 포기(변경)신청서 및 성적증명서 각 1부</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;4. 참고사항</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-INDENT: -49pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 49pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 복</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">수전공을 부전공으로 변경하고자 할 때에는 이수 성적</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">이 평점</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">평균 3.00이상 이어야 함.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-INDENT: -47.2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 47.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 복</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">수전공 및 부전공을 포기한 경우 기 취득한 학점은 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">일반선택학점으로,</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> 부전공으로 변경 시에는 부전공학점으로 인정함.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-INDENT: -49.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 49.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">다. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">졸</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">업 대상자 중에서 복수전공 및 부전공 이수자로 선발 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">되었으나</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"> </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">이</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">수가 불가능할 경우에는 반드시 이수 포기 신청을 하여야 함.</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 20pt\">2009. 11. 10</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 24pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 24pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;교&nbsp; 무&nbsp; 연&nbsp; 구&nbsp; 과&nbsp; 장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
